<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>Orchiviste Cockpit</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f4f1eb;
            --surface: #fffdf9;
            --ink: #1e2528;
            --muted: #5f676a;
            --accent: #0c6b58;
            --warning: #ac5d0c;
            --danger: #9b3a16;
            --border: #d9d2c4;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Avenir Next", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: linear-gradient(150deg, #f9f5ee 0%, #f2ece2 100%);
        }
        header {
            padding: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--surface);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        header nav a {
            margin-left: 14px;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .wrap {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 20px auto 40px;
            padding: 0 16px;
        }
        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        }
        .tool-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .tool-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .badge {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .badge-active { background: #e7f4ff; color: #145a97; }
        .badge-ready { background: #ebf8f4; color: var(--accent); }
        .badge-alpha { background: #fff6e7; color: var(--warning); }
        .badge-scaffold { background: #f3f3f3; color: #555; }
        .kv {
            margin: 6px 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .ok { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
        .ko { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 700; }
        .notice {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        .error {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--warning);
        }
        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }
        input, select, textarea {
            margin-top: 4px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px;
            font: inherit;
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        textarea {
            min-height: 150px;
            font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }
        .checkbox-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--warning);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .checkbox-row input {
            width: auto;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .btn {
            margin-top: 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 9px 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .warning-box {
            margin-top: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #e0c9b0;
            background: #fff7ee;
            color: #7c4c0f;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .mono {
            font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 8px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 9px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 12px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        th {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }
        .status-succeeded { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
        .status-failed { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 700; }
        .status-needs_review { color: var(--warning); font-weight: 700; }
        .status-not_implemented { color: #555; font-weight: 700; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <strong>Orchiviste Cockpit</strong>
    <nav>
        <a href="/ui">Tableau de bord</a>
        <a href="/ui/cockpit">Cockpit</a>
        <a href="/ui/setup">Configuration</a>
        <a href="/ui/jobs">Tâches</a>
        <a href="/ui/workers">Agents</a>
        <a href="/ui/presets">Préréglages</a>
        <a href="/ui/naming">Nommage</a>
        <a href="/ui/events">Événements</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
    #if(notice):
    <p class="notice">#(notice)</p>
    #endif
    #if(error):
    <p class="error">#(error)</p>
    #endif

    <section class="card">
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;">Catalogue des outils Muni</h2>
        #if(tools_present):
        <div class="grid">
            #for(tool in tools):
            <article class="tool-card">
                <h3>
                    <span>#(tool.display_name)</span>
                    <span class="badge badge-#(tool.integration_status)">v#(tool.version)</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="kv" style="margin-top:0;">#(tool.mission)</p>
                <p class="kv"><strong>Capacités:</strong> #(tool.capabilities)</p>
                <p class="kv"><strong>Disponibilité:</strong> <span class="#(tool.availability_class)">#(tool.availability_label)</span></p>
                <p class="kv"><strong>Cause:</strong> #(tool.availability_reason)</p>
                <p class="kv"><strong>Action par défaut:</strong> <span class="mono">#(tool.default_action)</span></p>
                <p class="kv"><strong>Dépôt:</strong> <span class="mono">#(tool.repository_path)</span></p>
            </article>
            #endfor
        </div>
        #else:
        <p>Aucun outil catalogué.</p>
        #endif
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;">Lancement canonique (`run --request --result`)</h2>
        <form action="/ui/cockpit/run" method="post">
            <div class="form-grid">
                <label>Tool
                    <select name="tool_id">
                        #for(tool in tools):
                        <option value="#(tool.id)" #(tool.selected_attribute)>#(tool.display_name)</option>
                        #endfor
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label>Action
                    <input type="text" name="action" value="#(selected_action)" placeholder="run">
                </label>
                <label>Workspace path (optionnel)
                    <input type="text" name="workspace_path" value="#(selected_workspace_path)">
                </label>
            </div>

            <label style="margin-top:10px;">Parameters JSON
                <textarea name="parameters_json">#(selected_parameters_json)</textarea>
            </label>

            <label style="margin-top:10px;">Input artifacts JSON (optionnel)
                <textarea name="input_artifacts_json">#(selected_input_artifacts_json)</textarea>
            </label>

            <label class="checkbox-row">
                <input type="checkbox" name="allow_destructive" value="1" #(selected_allow_destructive_attr)>
                Autoriser explicitement une exécution potentiellement destructive
            </label>

            <div class="warning-box">
                Le cockpit V1 privilégie les exécutions non destructives. Pour les outils sensibles, un garde-fou explicite est requis
                et les paramètres de confirmation (`confirm_*`) doivent aussi être présents dans le JSON.
            </div>

            <button class="btn" type="submit">Exécuter</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;">Historique local (`history.jsonl`)</h2>
        <p class="mono" style="margin:0 0 8px;">#(history_file)</p>

        #if(history_present):
        <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
            <table>
                <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Exécution</th>
                    <th>Tool</th>
                    <th>Action</th>
                    <th>Statut</th>
                    <th>Résumé</th>
                    <th>Horodatage</th>
                    <th>Code sortie</th>
                    <th>Fichiers</th>
                </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                #for(row in history_rows):
                <tr>
                    <td class="mono">#(row.execution_id)</td>
                    <td>#(row.tool_id)</td>
                    <td class="mono">#(row.action)</td>
                    <td class="status-#(row.status)">#(row.status_label)</td>
                    <td>#(row.summary)</td>
                    <td class="mono">Début: #(row.started_at)<br>Fin: #(row.finished_at)</td>
                    <td class="mono">#(row.exit_code)</td>
                    <td class="mono">req: #(row.request_file)<br>res: #(row.result_file)</td>
                </tr>
                #endfor
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        #else:
        <p>Aucune exécution enregistrée pour le moment.</p>
        #endif
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
